  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pot over medium heat",
    "Add bruised lemongrass and sliced galangal and saute for 1 minute",
    "Add tandoor spice mix and cook for 30 seconds",
    "Add shrimp and cook until pink, about 2-3 minutes",
    "Add light rum, fish sauce, and lime juice, and stir to combine",
    "Add chicken broth and bring to a boil",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 5 minutes",
    "Stir in coconut milk and cook for an additional 2 minutes",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning as needed",
    "Garnish with chopped Thai basil and kaffir lime leaves"
